u</surname><given-names>NK</given-names></name><name><surname>Lacin</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Kartal</surname><given-names>O</given-names></name><name><surname>Koyuncu</surname><given-names>F</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Rupture of rudimentary horn pregnancy at the 15th week of gestation: A case report</article-title><source>Eur J Obstet Gynecol Reprod Biol</source><year>2002</year><volume>102</volume><issue>2</issue><fpage>209</fpage><lpage>10</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11950494</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="CIT0009"><label>9</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Cutner</surname><given-names>Alfred</given-names></name><name><surname>Saridogan</surname><given-names>Ertan</given-names></name><name><surname>Hart</surname><given-names>Roger</given-names></name><name><surname>Pandya</surname><given-names>Pranav</given-names></name><name><surname>Creighton</surname><given-names>Sarah</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Laparoscopic management of pregnancies occurring in non-communicating accessory uterine horns</article-title><source>European Journal of Obstetrics &#x00026; Gynecology and Reproductive Biology</source><year>2004</year><volume>113</volume><fpage>106</fpage><lpage>109</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15036723</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="CIT0010"><label>10</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Dicker</surname><given-names>D.</given-names></name><name><surname>Nitke</surname><given-names>S.</given-names></name><name><surname>Shoenfeld</surname><given-names>A.</given-names></name><name><surname>Fish</surname><given-names>B.</given-names></name><name><surname>Meizner</surname><given-names>I.</given-names></name><name><surname>Ben-Rafael.</surname><given-names>Z.</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Laparoscopic management of rudimentary horn pregnancy</article-title><source>Hum Reprod</source><year>1998</year><volume>13</volume><fpage>2643</fpage><lpage>2644</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">9806300</pub-id></element-citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>